{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olaf and the Crowning Hangover is a comedic puzzle adventure where you stumble through the aftermath of a wild, booze-filled night. With a pounding headache and no recollection of last night, Olaf must piece together what happened and set things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To right Olaf\u2019s wrongs, you\u2019ll use a unique time-rewind mechanic that flips puzzle logic on its head. Instead of pushing crates, you\u2019re pulling events back into place: broken chairs mend themselves, spilt ale vanishes, and the world slowly returns to order one move at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sokoban, but in reverse\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to puzzle through the wreckage Olaf left behind, you\u2019ll need to do so by rewinding time. Restore objects, tidy up disasters, and uncover how Olaf\u2019s night spiralled out of control, one broken pub stool at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Right Olaf\u2019s Wrongs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/63489e6d01fa492e3330cd11ba74778b.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/63489e6d01fa492e3330cd11ba74778b.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/63489e6d01fa492e3330cd11ba74778b.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not being able to recall his actions from the night before, Olaf is tasked with righting his wrongs\u2026 and there are a lot of wrongs to right, including not delivering a certain order on time. An order that could cost him his head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olaf will meet (or re-meet) a wide variety of characters, from Grimlak the grumpy orc to King Charles de Valois who carefully hides his love for simple pleasures (like drinking and gambling).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dwarves, Black Humour &amp; Absurd Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/1885b76ad91e5b269ba08b21a824132d.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/1885b76ad91e5b269ba08b21a824132d.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/1885b76ad91e5b269ba08b21a824132d.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect witty dialogue, ridiculous situations, and a world where every problem has a solution\u2026 if you rewind far enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olaf has gotten himself in quite a pickle and with little memory of how it happened, his foggy memory and the recounts of those around him will shock even him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful pixel art style that blends nostalgic looks with clever modern puzzle design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With about two hours of dwarven mayhem, puzzles, and absurd comedy, Olaf and the Crowning Hangover is for fans of sokoban-style brainteasers, fantasy humour, and games that don\u2019t take themselves too seriously.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3001110?t=1761409262","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3001110?t=1761409262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/b0a79eb67c2545a19ac424e00b248d6d375b776a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761409262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/b0a79eb67c2545a19ac424e00b248d6d375b776a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761409262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game contains groans, vomiting and consuming alcohol. You can disable it by switching from the Beer to the Ginger Ale mode."},"demos":[{"appid":3528050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olaf and the Crowning Hangover is a comedic puzzle adventure where you stumble through the aftermath of a wild, booze-filled night. With a pounding headache and no recollection of last night, Olaf must piece together what happened and set things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To right Olaf\u2019s wrongs, you\u2019ll use a unique time-rewind mechanic that flips puzzle logic on its head. Instead of pushing crates, you\u2019re pulling events back into place: broken chairs mend themselves, spilt ale vanishes, and the world slowly returns to order one move at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sokoban, but in reverse\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/caf35f6ea9aa54d6a7127f42ecaf177b.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to puzzle through the wreckage Olaf left behind, you\u2019ll need to do so by rewinding time. Restore objects, tidy up disasters, and uncover how Olaf\u2019s night spiralled out of control, one broken pub stool at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Right Olaf\u2019s Wrongs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla