ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olaf has gotten himself in quite a pickle and with little memory of how it happened, his foggy memory and the recounts of those around him will shock even him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.poster.avif?t=1761409262\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.webm?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/extras/406f88423eedf4492b46c7d4c31a1cb9.mp4?t=1761409262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful pixel art style that blends nostalgic looks with clever modern puzzle design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With about two hours of dwarven mayhem, puzzles, and absurd comedy, Olaf and the Crowning Hangover is for fans of sokoban-style brainteasers, fantasy humour, and games that don\u2019t take themselves too seriously.</p>","developers":["Hidalgo code"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/13a78bc16a268a78aed2764ac0c65cb98e1f32a5/header.jpg?t=1761409262","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 7100 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Mem