r:</strong> i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hidalgo code"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q3 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cGreat game with a funny story, and the demo hints at a mysterious plot.\u201d<br>Thinky Games<br><br>\u201cThis game IS fun, the old-fashioned fun of clever conundrums, good writing, and a cheeky premise. Check it out!\u201d<br>Tiny Gaming<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/2a9c40caedb6498be69a4d332d159b0bee876578/ss_2a9c40caedb6498be69a4d332d159b0bee876578.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/2a9c40caedb6498be69a4d332d159b0bee876578/ss_2a9c40caedb6498be69a4d332d159b0bee876578.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/cd85cd731c514f1deb1489250813d7344aa5b81a/ss_cd85cd731c514f1deb1489250813d7344aa5b81a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/cd85cd731c514f1deb1489250813d7344aa5b81a/ss_cd85cd731c514f1deb1489250813d7344aa5b81a.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/d9cabffb51fb631349dcc839117e3b6f0c532b30/ss_d9cabffb51fb631349dcc839117e3b6f0c532b30.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/d9cabffb51fb631349dcc839117e3b6f0c532b30/ss_d9cabffb51fb631349dcc839117e3b6f0c532b30.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/30bdae88fbf6c1949a64c0e00bd163799eae76f5/ss_30bdae88fbf6c1949a64c0e00bd163799eae76f5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/30bdae88fbf6c1949a64c0e00bd163799eae76f5/ss_30bdae88fbf6c1949a64c0e00bd163799eae76f5.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/0f3e60680d4c1ba6650caf2647d20eeee3a56e88/ss_0f3e60680d4c1ba6650caf2647d20eeee3a56e88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/0f3e60680d4c1ba6650caf2647d20eeee3a56e88/ss_0f3e60680d4c1ba6650caf2647d20eeee3a56e88.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/d595b8d41c0d6d461772ebf3a0b81515e13b68a8/ss_d595b8d41c0d6d461772ebf3a0b81515e13b68a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/d595b8d41c0d6d461772ebf3a0b81515e13b68a8/ss_d595b8d41c0d6d461772ebf3a0b81515e13b68a8.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/3e6e5d20d64b441dd92925d72549c6e596f1aaa2/ss_3e6e5d20d64b441dd92925d72549c6e596f1aaa2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/3e6e5d20d64b441dd92925d72549c6e596f1aaa2/ss_3e6e5d20d64b441dd92925d72549c6e596f1aaa2.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/87d15ae5803ea67ed6cff06d280bdaff981c3d96/ss_87d15ae5803ea67ed6cff06d280bdaff981c3d96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761409262","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001110/87d15ae5803ea67ed6cff06d280bdaff981c3d96/ss_87d15ae5803ea67ed6cff06d280bdaff981c3d96.600x338.jpg?t=1761409262"}],"short_description":"Olaf, a dwarf jeweler, wakes up after an epic drinking session, missing both his memory and the royal crown. Piece together your &quot;heroic deeds&quot; from last night by solving puzzles backwards, and embark on a comical adventure to find the crown and escape execution!","steam_appid":3001110,"support_info":{"email":"mihaw.wolodymyr@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Ukrainian, German, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}